---
description: UI copy and user-facing content default to US English
alwaysApply: true
---

# English by default

- All user-visible strings in this app (labels, headings, descriptions, `metadata`, data summaries, footer text) must be **English (US)** unless the user explicitly requests another language.
- Keep `lang="en"` on the document root when using a single locale.
- Code comments may be English; avoid mixing Turkish or other locales in the UI layer.
